 lic household. Fresh off of performing on Bert Kreischer’s “Fully Loade
 d“ cruise\, Liam performed on the Impractical Jokers cruise and the Netfl
 ix is a Joke comedy festival in Los Angeles. He has opened for big acts lik
 e Mark Normand\, Rachel Feinstein and Cipha Sounds. He just finished his st
 int as a radio personality on New York radio station 94.7 the block. When h
 e’s not touring the country or seas\, Liam performs all over New York Cit
 y and uploads sketches to his social media daily. Whitney Chanel is a New Y
 ork City comedian whose work has been featured on VH1\, Bravo\, Tubi\, Buzz
 Feed\, and The Sweet Spot. Known for her sharp storytelling and authentic p
 erspective\, Whitney creates a space where audiences can laugh\, relate\, a
 nd see their own life experiences reflected on stage. Her comedy is honest\
 , engaging\, and unapologetically real\, inviting people to embrace their a
 uthentic selves while finding humor in everyday life.Originally from the Ba
 y Area\, Salma Zaky moved to Los Angeles to attend college\, where she bega
 n her comedy journey. Salma has filmed a mini stand-up special with OnlyFan
 s on OFTV (unfortunately clothed)\, as well as a Don't Tell taping. She now
